OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,6,Fday as a band of rain progresses
OL,7,Fslowly eastward, clearing by the end
OL,8,Fof the day. Rain may become heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes. Light winds to start, breezy
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells with isolated
OL,13,Flight showers through the evening.
OL,14,FBecoming mostly dry and clear
OL,15,Fovernight, though cloudier along
OL,16,Feastern coasts. Breezy, perhaps strong
OL,17,Fnear coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
